OL,3,GNEWSAWatch as farmer uses tractor to
OL,4,Ashunt neighbour's truck in road row
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farmer used his tractor to lift and
OL,7,Fmove a neighbour's pickup truck off the
OL,8,Fground, causing enough damage to write
OL,9,Foff the vehicle, after a dispute over
OL,10,Faccess to his land.
OL,12,FCerdin Jones, 53, from Llanarth in
OL,13,FCeredigion, drove his Massey Ferguson
OL,14,Ftractor into the Fiat Fullback,
OL,15,Fhoisting it up and moving it about 20
OL,16,Fyards (18 metres) through a country
OL,17,Flane.
OL,19,FThe pickup truck belonged to
OL,20,Fneighbouring farmer Anwen Hughes and
OL,21,Fwas later written off due to the
OL,22,Festimated #5,000 worth of damage.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
