OL,3,GNEWSAWatch as farmer uses tractor to
OL,4,Ashunt neighbour's truck in road row
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was found guilty of criminal damage
OL,7,Fto property and was handed a fine and
OL,8,Fgiven a restraining order at
OL,9,FAberystwyth Magistrates' Court last
OL,10,Fmonth.
